omx-plugins (0.15.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * omx-plugins 0.15.0: version, omx-contract floor 3.4.0, changelog entries
  * packaging: the omx-clap-core floor names 0.14.0, the first tag that
    carries what 0.13.0 was to (ops#275)
  * round-trip: the stepped-to-log scan entry holds through plugin-hostd
    0.12.0 (#235)
  * CI: add the OpenMixer repository with the add-openmixer action
  * Install the OpenMixer repository from the openmixer-release package
  * docs: omx-plugins-contract carries param-units.json, the source of the
    header's unit enum
  * ci: omx-plugins-contract lists param-units.json
  * omx_param_contract.h: the unit enum is generated from
    contract/param-units.json
  * contract: the param-contract unit codes are a sheet in omx-plugins'
    contract directory
  * docs: omx-plugins-contract carries the descriptors; omx-contract floor
    3.3.0
  * packaging: the descriptors ship in a noarch omx-plugins-contract
    (omx-contract#150)
  * round-trip: the stepped-to-log scan entry holds through plugin-hostd
    0.11.0 (#235)
  * round-trip: the stepped-to-log scan entry holds through plugin-hostd
    0.11.0 (#235)
  * recipe-selftest: the chain holds omx-dsp 0.26.0's new gate and comp
    controls (#236)
  * round-trip: the stepped-to-log scan entry holds through plugin-hostd
    0.10.0 (#235)
  * round-trip: the stepped-to-log scan entry holds through plugin-hostd
    0.10.0 (#235)
  * preset-probe: a staged location longer than its buffer is refused, not
    truncated (#235)
  * packaging: omx-dsp floor 0.26.0 (#236)
  * plugins: comp, delay, gate and reverb hold omx-dsp 0.26.0's new resolve
    arguments (#236)
  * gen: a declaration holds a face argument at its kernel's named default
    (#236)

